# Dependencies / build output (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/src/generated

# Env & secrets — never bake into images; compose injects at runtime
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.template
!**/.env.*.template

# Runtime data
apps/api/uploads
**/*.log

# VCS / editor
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea

# Tests / tooling not needed in images
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
terminals

# Docs & guides
docs
guide
*.md
!apps/**/README.md
